# ---------------------------------------------------------------- generated
# Everything the pipeline produces about a real person lives here. This file is
# the first commit in the repo for exactly that reason: a contributor WILL run
# the pipeline inside their own clone, and this is what stops their address,
# their phone number and their job history reaching a pull request.
